@using DigiStore.Models
@model List<Product>
<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2403a15 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2403a15" data-element_type="container">
    <div class="e-con-inner">
        <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e48596 elementor-widget elementor-widget-moboland_best_sell_widget" data-id="8e48596" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="moboland_best_sell_widget.default">
            <div class="elementor-widget-container">


                <section class="main-sell">
                    <header class="title-product">
                        <h4>
                            <a href="#">پرفروشترین محصولات موبولند</a>
                        </h4>
                    </header>

                    <div class="box-sell">


                        <div class="best-sell">
                            <div class="head-best-sell">
                                <div>
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i>
                                    <p>پرفروشترین محصول</p>
                                </div>
                                <span>رتبه 1</span>
                            </div>
                            <figure>
                                <a href="/Product/Index"> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123.webp" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" srcset="https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123.webp 800w, https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123-300x300.webp 300w, https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123-100x100.webp 100w, https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123-600x600.webp 600w, https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123-150x150.webp 150w, https://mobowebs.ir//wp-content/uploads/2024/10/dcd6e4e843bea3f070614a95d27b1181fdf23008_1727276123-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></a>
                            </figure>
                            <h2>
                                <a href="/Product/Index" target="_blank"> گوشی موبایل اپل مدل iPhone 13 Pro Max ZAA دو سیم‌ ...</a>
                            </h2>

                            <div class="price">

                                <span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount"><bdi>87,000,000&nbsp;<span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol">تومان</span></bdi></span>
                            </div>



                            <div class="add-cart">
                                <a href="product/%da%af%d9%88%d8%b4%db%8c-%d9%85%d9%88%d8%a8%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%84-%d8%a7%d9%be%d9%84-%d9%85%d8%af%d9%84-iphone-13-pro-max-zaa-%d8%af%d9%88-%d8%b3%db%8c%d9%85-%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%b8%d8%b1/index.html">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-plus"></i>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>



                        <div class="other-sell">

                            @if(Model.Any())
                            {
                                foreach(var item in Model)
                                {
                                    <div class="product-item">
                                        <figure>

                                            <a href="/Product/Details/@item.Id/@item.Slug"> 
                                                <img decoding="async" width="800" height="800" src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/@(item.MainImageName)" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt=""  sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /><i class="fa-regular fa-eye"></i></a>
                                            @* <img decoding="async"
                                                 src="/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/@(product.MainImageName)"
                                                 alt="@(product.Title)" /> *@
                                        </figure>
                                        <h2>
                                            <a href="/Product/Details/@item.Id/@item.Slug"
                                               target="_blank"> @item.Title 
                                               </a>
                                        </h2>

                                        <div class="down-product">
                                            <span class="number">
                                                2
                                            </span>

                                            <div class="price">
                                                @if (item.OldPrice.HasValue)
                                                {
                                                    <del aria-hidden="true">
                                                        <span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount">
                                                            @item.OldPrice.Value.ToString("N0")&nbsp;<span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol">تومان</span>
                                                        </span>
                                                    </del>
                                                }

                                                <ins aria-hidden="true" style="text-decoration: none;">
                                                    <span class="woocommerce-Price-amount amount">
                                                        @item.Price.ToString("N0")&nbsp;<span class="woocommerce-Price-currencySymbol">تومان</span>
                                                    </span>
                                                </ins>
                                            </div>


                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                }
                            }

                        </div>


                    </div>

                </section>


            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>